CLAUDE.md


# Internal working material. This repository is PUBLIC (it serves www.eurekalabs.ch),
# so nothing here may be committed: blog/ holds unpublished drafts carrying raw
# campaign numbers and internal experiment references, docs/ holds the investor
# plan and the editorial rules. Published figures live in public/blog/figures/.
/blog/
/docs/

# Build output. The deploy workflow runs its own npm run build and publishes
# ./dist to the gh-pages branch, so a copy committed here is never read, only
# drifts from source. The SPA fallback (404.html) is regenerated by npm run build.
dist/
